From 5ce933484e8179a5ac123b2ed3e183717b3e280e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tehcneko <chsqwyx@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Apr 2025 17:18:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] WebUI: Optimize table performance with virtual list

Adding virtual list support to dynamic tables to improve performance on large lists, I observed a 100x performance improvement on rendering on a torrent table with 5000 torrents.
This optimization is disabled by default and can be enabled in options.

PR #22502.

(cherry picked from commit b4a16f64641873bd067ab5f6c6d54c0b4c12fdcf)

Backport to 5.1.4: removed rows use tr.remove() as in 5.1.x; the log tables keep
5.1.4's className assignment so reused rows do not accumulate classes.
